1
00:00:00,309 --> 00:00:02,349
(Leonard:)Think it's gonna rain?

2
00:00:04,188 --> 00:00:08,188
(Leonard:)Instead of underpants, I covered
my crotch with potato salad. Thoughts?

3
00:00:10,653 --> 00:00:14,493
(Leonard:)I know what'll cheer you up.
Let's play one of your driving games.

4
00:00:14,907 --> 00:00:18,497
(Sheldon:)All right. This game is called Traitors.

5
00:00:20,704 --> 00:00:22,664
(Sheldon:)I will name three historical figures...

6
00:00:22,831 --> 00:00:25,711
(Sheldon:)...put them in order
of the heinousness of their betrayal:

7
00:00:25,876 --> 00:00:30,256
(Sheldon:)Benedict Arnold, Judas,
Dr. Leonard Hofstadter.

8
00:00:31,090 --> 00:00:33,800
(Leonard:)You really think I belong
with Benedict Arnold and Judas?

9
00:00:34,176 --> 00:00:37,926
(Sheldon:)You're right. Judas had the decency
to hang himself after what he did.

10
00:00:39,139 --> 00:00:42,849
(Leonard:)Can't you at least try to understand
how much this means to me?

11
00:00:44,645 --> 00:00:49,525
Round two: Leonard Hofstadter,
Darth Vader, Rupert Murdoch.

12
00:00:49,817 --> 00:00:50,947
(Leonard:)Rupert Murdoch?

13
00:00:51,235 --> 00:00:56,025
(Sheldon:)He owns Fox
and they cancelled Firefly.

